{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes the first case of Shutter Evidence (approximately 20 minutes). The full game contains 20 cases, drone upgrade options, and in addition to single-player mode, features co-op for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shutter Evidence is an exploration-action experience where you pilot a drone through active crime scenes, illuminating secrets by photographing evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Each crime scene carries its own atmosphere, puzzles, and dark secrets. Some areas are locked; as you find keys, you'll access new sections and step into areas filled with deeper mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105880/extras/fda9016372f059d9a9025ef206ae55c1.poster.avif?t=1762179829\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105880/extras/fda9016372f059d9a9025ef206ae55c1.webm?t=1762179829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105880/extras/fda9016372f059d9a9025ef206ae55c1.mp4?t=1762179829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photograph The right angle, perfect timing, and striking composition \u2014 these earn you the most valuable evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105880/extras/ba0d00fec369333566bfbe7a19d8ed7a.poster.avif?t=1762179829\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105880/extras/ba0d00fec369333566bfbe7a19d8ed7a.webm?t=1762179829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105880/extras/ba0d00fec369333566bfbe7a19d8ed7a.mp4?t=1762179829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress From abandoned houses to dark warehouses, from luxury villas to mysterious workplaces \u2014 each location presents a different challenge. As your missions progress, perpetrators become more alert and evidence is hidden deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105880/extras/887285342f9a29abca240b77ccc09ad5.poster.avif?t=1762179829\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105880/extras/887285342f9a29abca240b77ccc09ad5.webm?t=1762179829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105880/extras/887285342f9a29abca240b77ccc09ad5.mp4?t=1762179829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide The perpetrators are still at the scene. The moment they spot you, tension rises and your drone can take heavy damage; therefore, stealth, caution, and quick thinking are the keys to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105880/extras/72eca4988d251d6c0cfb5f2e442f9d49.poster.avif?t=1762179829\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105880/extras/72eca4988d251d6c0cfb5f2e442f9d49.webm?t=1762179829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105880/extras/72eca4988d251d6c0cfb5f2e442f9d49.mp4?t=1762179829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner hides a secret. Ready your camera, collect your keys, and start photographing evidence to uncover the truth. Shutter Evidence \u2014 enter silently, record everything, leave without a trace.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4105880?t=1762179829","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4105880?t=1762179829","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105880/5c2332c34ffade52daf8157760bd77e0dc3d29bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762179829","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105880/5c2332c34ffade52daf8157760bd77e0dc3d29bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762179829","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes the first case of Shutter Evidence (approximately 20 minutes). The full game contains 20 cases, drone upgrade options, and in addition to single-player mode, features co-op for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shutter Evidence is an exploration-action experience where you pilot a drone through active crime scenes, illuminating secrets by photographing evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Each crime scene carries its own atmosphere, puzzles, and dark secrets. Some areas are locked; as you find keys, you'll access new sections and step into areas filled with deeper mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.stea